## Task routing

| Change scope | Start from | Expected destination |
|---|---|---|
| Shared behavior, security, tests, automation or documentation | `{{canonical_branch}}` | The owning shared source |
| One Minecraft version or loader | `{{canonical_branch}}` | Its owning version adapter or loader module |
| Supported version/loader inventory | The release inventory | A validated target built from the same source |
| Generated output or staged artifacts | Nowhere | Fix the tracked input instead |

